      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T17:19:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this actually true? Especially since you\u0027ve updated our helper function to have `outConversionInfo-\u003efComponents \u003d formatProps.samplerYcbcrConversionComponents;` Regardless I don\u0027t think we actually do ignore that value internally, so if I client were to set it even with an externalFormat we\u0027d still use it, right?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 107,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 107,
        "endChar": 56
      },
      "revId": "f56d5d794ada1bbf8f017e2ba1bf94c3a51ecee9",
